				"points": [
					{
						"sceneId": 3,
						"position": [
							2155.005,
							109.349,
							11195.66
						],
						"pointId": 360300006
					}
				]
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 760520501,
					"content": "*glug*... *glug*...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760520502
					],
					"speakerTitle": "The Damselette"
				},
				{
					"id": 760520502,
					"content": "Wow, that was quick! Looks like she loves it!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760520503
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 760520503,
					"content": "Hm... completely flavorless.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760520504
					],
					"speakerTitle": "The Damselette"
				},
				{
					"id": 760520504,
					"content": "F—f—flavorless!?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760520505
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 760520505,
					"content": "Yes.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760520506,
						760520507
					],
					"speakerTitle": "The Damselette"
				},
				{
					"id": 760520506,
					"content": "Maybe you drank it too fast...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760520508
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 760520508,
					"content": "Oh... Thanks, but no need.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760520509
					],
					"speakerTitle": "The Damselette"
				},
				{
					"id": 760520509,
					"content": "There was a time when I failed to understand why people felt such joy at harvest time. Then, one day, I reached out to touch a piece of ripe fruit hanging from a branch...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760520510
					],
					"speakerTitle": "The Damselette"
				},
				{
					"id": 760520510,
					"content": "I sensed vitality in the very texture of its skin — the organic embodiment of sunlight, water, earth, and air.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760520511
					],
					"speakerTitle": "The Damselette"
				},
				{
					"id": 760520511,
					"content": "With each bite, I felt a refreshing sweetness surge over me like waves of cool white foam.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760520512
					],
					"speakerTitle": "The Damselette"
				},
				{
					"id": 760520512,
					"content": "And that's how I came to understand the irresistible power of aroma.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760520513
					],
					"speakerTitle": "The Damselette"
				},
				{
					"id": 760520513,
					"content": "Oh, that's interesting!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760520514
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 760520514,
					"content": "Then, we complete nature's cycle by taking that life force for ourselves.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760520515
					],
					"speakerTitle": "The Damselette"
				},
				{
					"id": 760520515,
					"content": "Uhh, that suddenly turned kinda dark...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760520516
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 760520516,
					"content": "That is why I prefer fresh fruit. It allows me to see what I took from this world, exactly as it was before I took it.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760520517
					],
					"speakerTitle": "The Damselette"
				},
				{
					"id": 760520517,
					"content": "And reminds me of what I owe this world in return...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "The Damselette"
				},
				{
					"id": 760520507,
					"content": "Why don't I make you another one?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760520508
					]
				}
			]
		},
